Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is there any objection? Hearing none, consideration of the budget of the Department of Tourism is in order.

4357
04:00:35,380 --> 04:00:39,220
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We recognize the sponsor, Senator Erwin Tulfo.

4358
04:00:39,480 --> 04:00:43,440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. President. Thank you, Mr. Majority Floor Leader.

4359
04:00:44,260 --> 04:00:51,160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: As Vice Chair of the Committee on Finance, I'm honored to defend the fiscal year 2027 budget of the Department of Tourism,

4360
04:00:51,160 --> 04:00:57,100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: its attached agencies, namely Intramuros Administration, National Parks Development Committee,

4361
04:00:57,720 --> 04:00:58,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Philippine Commission

4362
04:00:58,560 --> 04:01:03,820
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and Sports Scuba Diving and Corporations, namely the Duty-Free Philippines Corporation,

4363
04:01:04,540 --> 04:01:09,620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tourism Infrastructure and Enterprise Zone Authority, and Tourism Promotions Board.

4364
04:01:09,620 --> 04:01:16,120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: At the core of the DOT's mandate is the unwavering commitment to position the Philippines as a premier,

4365
04:01:16,700 --> 04:01:23,800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sustainable, and inclusive tourist destination, ensuring the tourism sector remains a pillar of our national economy.

4366
04:01:24,580 --> 04:01:27,620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: In fiscal year 2025, the economic contribution of tourism,

4367
04:01:28,500 --> 04:01:32,540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: reached a staggering 2.27 trillion pesos.

4368
04:01:33,240 --> 04:01:35,760
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Our tourist arrivals also continue to grow steadily,

4369
04:01:36,280 --> 04:01:44,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: from 3.31 million in the first semester of fiscal year 2025 to 3.41 million for fiscal year 2026.

4370
04:01:44,700 --> 04:01:48,400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: This growth is bolstered by DOT's outstanding global accomplishments,

4371
04:01:48,400 --> 04:01:55,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: which include the successful launch of 20 new international flights as of September 2026,

4372
04:01:56,220 --> 04:01:58,400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: bringing in 472,240

4373
04:01:58,500 --> 04:02:02,540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: projected sold seats.

4374
04:02:03,080 --> 04:02:09,160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Furthermore, the Philippines is proudly secured a spot as the number one retirement destination in the world.

4375
04:02:09,280 --> 04:02:18,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Our unmatched marine biodiversity has also earned us the title of the world's leading dive destination for seven consecutive years,

4376
04:02:18,840 --> 04:02:24,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: propelling us to the top five globally in terms of highest income generated from dive tourism.

4377
04:02:25,700 --> 04:02:28,440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Additionally, our aggressive push for astronomy tourism,

4378
04:02:28,500 --> 04:02:30,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: has yielded remarkable results,

4379
04:02:30,500 --> 04:02:35,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: generating a value of 366 million pesos in 2025.

4380
04:02:35,500 --> 04:02:43,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mr. President, despite these monumental achievements and the massive returns the sector brings to our economy,

4381
04:02:43,500 --> 04:02:51,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: the funding for the department and its attached agencies will have a total available appropriation of only 4.03 billion

4382
04:02:51,500 --> 04:02:54,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: in the National Expenditure Program of 2027.

4383
04:02:54,500 --> 04:02:57,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: This is 337.7 million lower,

4384
04:02:58,500 --> 04:03:07,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: presenting a 7.7% decrease compared to the 4.37 billion budget in 2026.

4385
04:03:07,500 --> 04:03:09,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: As for the attached corporations,

4386
04:03:09,500 --> 04:03:16,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: their respective funding levels show varying increases and reductions under the NEP 2027.

4387
04:03:16,500 --> 04:03:27,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: The duty-free Philippines corporation will have an increase in its total sources of funds from 2.074 billion in 2026 to 2.472 billion

4388
04:03:27,500 --> 04:03:28,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: in 2027.

4389
04:03:28,500 --> 04:03:30,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: On the other hand,

4390
04:03:30,500 --> 04:03:41,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: TIEZA's approved corporate operating budget decreased from 12.7 billion in 2026 to 7.7 billion in 2027.

4391
04:03:41,500 --> 04:03:52,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Similarly, the Tourism Promotions Board total funding declined from 1.864 billion in 2026 to 1.119 billion in 2027.

4392
04:03:52,500 --> 04:03:57,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: The National Parks Development Committee's COB also decreased

4393
04:03:57,500 --> 04:04:02,460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: From 81.6 million pesos to 73 million pesos.

4394
04:04:03,040 --> 04:04:09,320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Meanwhile, the Philippine Retirement Authority will rely entirely on its corporate fund for 2027

4395
04:04:09,320 --> 04:04:13,920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: with no national government subsidy or trust receipts program.

4396
04:04:14,720 --> 04:04:19,980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: We would like to thank the Chairperson of the Committee on Finance, Senator J.V. Ejercito,

4397
04:04:20,280 --> 04:04:23,760
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: for his continued support strengthening the department's programs,

4398
04:04:23,760 --> 04:04:29,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: particularly additional funding for marketing, promotions, branding of our tourism.

4399
04:04:30,200 --> 04:04:33,800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Patuloy natin nawang mahalin at ipagmalaki ang ating bayan.

4400
04:04:34,200 --> 04:04:36,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ika nga, love the Philippines.

4401
