Senator Mark A. Villar: It has to be infrastructure.

6182
05:18:58,540 --> 05:18:59,140
Senator Mark A. Villar: It has to be market.

6183
05:18:59,180 --> 05:18:59,560
Senator Mark A. Villar: It has to be marketing.

6184
