6210
05:21:03,760 --> 05:21:08,320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: If we compare ourselves to Vietnam, Singapore, Thailand.

6211
05:21:08,880 --> 05:21:12,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: They spend like over hundreds of millions of dollars,

6212
05:21:12,580 --> 05:21:17,200
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: while the Philippines only spends like around 52 million dollars.

6213
05:21:17,200 --> 05:21:19,960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, you see the disparity Mr.President.

6214
05:21:20,140 --> 05:21:22,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Dahil sa napaka laki.

6215
05:21:22,960 --> 05:21:24,540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I'll give you, I'll start your example.

6216
05:21:24,960 --> 05:21:28,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: In 2025 lamang po,

6217
05:21:28,500 --> 05:21:40,280
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Thailand spent $196 million and yung arrival po nila was 32.97 million tourists.

6218
05:21:40,740 --> 05:21:47,780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Malaysia spent $335 million, dumating po sa kanila is 26.61 million tourists.

6219
05:21:48,520 --> 05:21:57,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Vietnam funded their tourism, 183.43 in campaign.

6220
05:21:57,240 --> 05:22:01,620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung arrival po nila was 21.17 million.

6221
05:22:02,260 --> 05:22:12,260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: And then Singapore, for $22 million, yung arrival po nila is 16.91 million people or tourists.

6222
05:22:12,840 --> 05:22:13,920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Indonesia, ganun din po.

6223
05:22:14,340 --> 05:22:22,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Indonesia went down actually, yung kanilang budget of 54.47,

6224
05:22:22,500 --> 05:22:25,840
