6229
05:22:47,120 --> 05:22:50,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: At bumaba pa nga po noong 2025 to 49.72 million.

6230
05:22:50,700 --> 05:22:55,780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: And I believe these are some of the reasons, Mr. President, kung bakit.

6231
05:22:55,840 --> 05:23:00,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mababa po yung arrivals natin because of ika nga yung campaign.

6232
05:23:00,420 --> 05:23:03,740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Unlike other countries na talagang sobra yung kanilang promotions.

6233
05:23:04,660 --> 05:23:09,260
Senator Mark A. Villar: Yes, and I think promotions, very important aspect of tourism.

6234
05:23:09,940 --> 05:23:17,100
