Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Bigay na lang.

8186
06:53:51,720 --> 06:53:53,900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Would you be okay with the peso amount?

8187
06:53:54,080 --> 06:53:56,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi we can look at it from peso amount or classrooms?

8188
06:53:56,340 --> 06:53:59,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang hihingingin ko lang, yung update lang sa mga numbers.

8189
06:53:59,680 --> 06:54:02,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi ang daming nagtatanong, mga LGU pati,

8190
