Senator Imee R. Marcos: nagtatanong, kailan ba sila mabibigyan?

8191
06:54:04,820 --> 06:54:05,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang daming nagpa-follow up.

8192
06:54:05,980 --> 06:54:07,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano naman ninyo yun eh?

8193
06:54:07,540 --> 06:54:09,560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Parati kayong kinukulit, hindi lang naman ako.

8194
06:54:09,560 --> 06:54:13,100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Once they do the RPA, that's the crucial act, yung notice to award.

8195
06:54:13,520 --> 06:54:14,200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Then we download that.

8196
06:54:14,200 --> 06:54:15,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay. So, Madam President,

8197
06:54:15,720 --> 06:54:21,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the number of LGUs currently at the preparatory phase is 425.

8198
06:54:21,700 --> 06:54:25,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay. So, na-assume natin yung preparatory means sa ano?

8199
06:54:26,560 --> 06:54:28,840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Preparatory meaning kakapirma lang ng MOA?

8200
06:54:29,020 --> 06:54:29,520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ah, so wala.

8201
06:54:29,520 --> 06:54:30,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala pang SARO?

8202
06:54:30,660 --> 06:54:32,660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sino yung actual na may SARO?

8203
06:54:32,660 --> 06:54:33,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, the SARO is with DepEd.

8204
06:54:34,280 --> 06:54:35,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: SARO of the DepEd.

8205
06:54:35,700 --> 06:54:37,660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How big is the SARO of the DepEd?

8206
06:54:38,040 --> 06:54:39,620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The actual SARO of the DepEd.

8207
06:54:41,980 --> 06:54:46,040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 16. So, 16 billion is the first SARO of DepEd.

8208
06:54:46,560 --> 06:54:48,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's all you have so far?

8209
06:54:48,700 --> 06:54:49,840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For LGU implementation.

8210
06:54:50,300 --> 06:54:51,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For LGU.

8211
06:54:51,380 --> 06:54:53,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: For DepEd and for Public Works.

8212
06:54:53,280 --> 06:54:55,140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kanina yun sa Public Works, 7 billion.

8213
06:54:55,260 --> 06:54:55,500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 7.

8214
06:54:56,380 --> 06:54:58,860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos yung sa, kung an, sa...

8215
06:54:58,860 --> 06:55:00,000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: DepEd.

8216
06:55:00,520 --> 06:55:00,940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 16?

8217
06:55:01,280 --> 06:55:04,100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But that will go up to...

8218
06:55:04,100 --> 06:55:06,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Akala ko 16 yung LGU.

8219
06:55:06,820 --> 06:55:10,500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, initially, Madam President, that's just 16 out of 48.

8220
06:55:10,960 --> 06:55:11,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, once that...

8221
06:55:11,960 --> 06:55:13,760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 48 na?

8222
06:55:13,900 --> 06:55:14,360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah, 48.

8223
06:55:14,360 --> 06:55:15,560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Oh, 48. Yes.

8224
06:55:15,660 --> 06:55:16,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I recall from last year.

8225
06:55:17,340 --> 06:55:21,260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the SARO of DepEd for this whole program is...

8226
06:55:21,260 --> 06:55:21,900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 48 billion.

8227
06:55:23,280 --> 06:55:23,800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 40...

8228
06:55:23,800 --> 06:55:24,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 49.

8229
06:55:24,360 --> 06:55:25,300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 49 billion.

8230
06:55:25,500 --> 06:55:26,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: About 49 billion already.

8231
06:55:26,960 --> 06:55:28,560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 49 billion already?

8232
06:55:28,860 --> 06:55:38,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of which, 43 billion are for new classrooms, 3.5 for learning continuity spaces, and 3 billion for last mile schools.

8233
06:55:39,500 --> 06:55:42,660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We also have 118 million for acquisition of existing buildings.

8234
06:55:43,140 --> 06:55:46,700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, this is already with DepEd, and this is being rolled out.

8235
06:55:47,760 --> 06:55:55,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, at this point, they've had partnerships with the LGUs already, and they're in the process of rolling this out, Madam President.

8236
06:55:55,080 --> 06:55:55,820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's right.

8237
06:55:55,960 --> 06:55:58,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The reason I'm asking is, yun nga.

8238
06:55:58,860 --> 06:56:02,420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Abalang-abala ang tao kung kailan sila magkakaroon ng classroom.

8239
06:56:02,580 --> 06:56:10,840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Higit sa lahat, magtatanong, pati ang ating mga kasamahan dito, kung kailan na mabibigyan ng mga classroom.

8240
06:56:11,020 --> 06:56:13,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pagkat ang laki-laki ng binigay last year.

8241
06:56:14,100 --> 06:56:14,440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Exactly.

8242
06:56:14,660 --> 06:56:16,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Talagang blockbuster yun nangyari last year.

8243
06:56:16,640 --> 06:56:16,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Exactly.

8244
06:56:17,180 --> 06:56:18,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: First time in the history.

8245
06:56:18,540 --> 06:56:18,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

8246
06:56:18,820 --> 06:56:21,780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: E pakatapos, nagkakaturuan, nagkakasitahan.

8247
06:56:22,400 --> 06:56:25,200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang laki na nga ng pera, naging bato pa.

8248
06:56:25,200 --> 06:56:26,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit wala pa rin classroom?

8249
06:56:27,080 --> 06:56:27,940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yun ang katanong nyo.

8250
06:56:27,940 --> 06:56:28,700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we're getting...

8251
06:56:28,860 --> 06:56:36,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We're getting word here from the good secretary that this was the first time that DEPED was working with the LGUs.

8252
06:56:36,260 --> 06:56:36,720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's right.

8253
06:56:37,720 --> 06:56:38,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Downloading it to the LGUs.

8254
06:56:38,920 --> 06:56:40,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And downloading direct to LGUs.

8255
06:56:40,580 --> 06:56:44,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And even civil society and so on who are accredited.

8256
06:56:44,220 --> 06:56:45,640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Well, we haven't done that yet actually.

8257
06:56:45,900 --> 06:56:46,840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I remember we spent so much time.

8258
06:56:47,480 --> 06:56:48,620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We haven't done that yet, no?

8259
06:56:48,700 --> 06:56:48,980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Wala pa.

8260
06:56:48,980 --> 06:56:50,180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, DEPED hasn't done that yet.

8261
06:56:50,200 --> 06:56:52,400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero nandun sa budget yun eh.

8262
06:56:52,620 --> 06:56:53,940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's in the special provision.

8263
06:56:53,940 --> 06:56:58,440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And these are also the subject matter of the Classroom Acceleration Program,

8264
06:56:58,440 --> 06:57:01,660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which we passed here in the Senate, but it's not passed in Congress.

8265
06:57:01,800 --> 06:57:05,760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero isang taon na, wala pang na-accredit na NGO at saka civil society?

8266
06:57:06,500 --> 06:57:06,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Meron na.

8267
06:57:06,520 --> 06:57:10,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Meron na-accredited, but they haven't actually done a partnership in terms of classroom building.

8268
06:57:11,060 --> 06:57:11,500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit natatagalan?

8269
06:57:11,680 --> 06:57:16,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi ina-anticipate namin na katulad ng Chinese Chamber, for example,

8270
06:57:16,320 --> 06:57:20,020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na napakasipag magpatayo ng classroom, na mapapabilis.

8271
06:57:20,760 --> 06:57:23,000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit bumagal pa rin?

8272
06:57:24,800 --> 06:57:27,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I think that NGOs, that is the concern.

8273
06:57:27,340 --> 06:57:27,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you.

8274
06:57:28,440 --> 06:57:42,620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, there are a few CSOs who have applied, Mr. President.

8275
06:57:42,780 --> 06:57:46,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Only one has been accredited so far, and that's the Chinese Chamber.

8276
06:57:46,700 --> 06:57:51,280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yeah, yung Chinese Chamber have really made an advocacy of classroom building,

8277
06:57:51,500 --> 06:57:54,040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and they've been very efficient at it.

8278
06:57:54,140 --> 06:57:57,140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya magtataka ako, sila lang, talagang sila lang.

8279
06:57:57,140 --> 06:57:58,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sila pa lang.

8280
06:57:58,440 --> 06:57:59,000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sila pa lang.

8281
06:57:59,340 --> 06:58:02,160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But in process, there are a few other CSOs who are in process.

8282
06:58:02,160 --> 06:58:03,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yeah, rather disappointing results.

8283
06:58:04,100 --> 06:58:11,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We were all expecting a much more enthusiastic response to the release of these very large funds,

8284
06:58:12,440 --> 06:58:20,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which brings me to the subject of the percentage of the budget that's dedicated to education.

8285
06:58:20,700 --> 06:58:27,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Time and again, the UNESCO and other educational research institutions

8286
06:58:27,900 --> 06:58:33,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: have said that Filipino education has been plagued with endemic underfunding.

8287
06:58:33,860 --> 06:58:37,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Parating yan ang sinasabi, paulit-ulit, kulang ang pondo, kulang ang pondo.

8288
06:58:37,580 --> 06:58:45,360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya hindi gumagaling ang estudyante, kapo sa mga teacher, at kulang-kulang ang ating mga school building.

8289
06:58:45,800 --> 06:58:56,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ganun pa man, pag titignan mo, from 2023, ang ating gastos ay 3.68% of GDP

8290
06:58:56,540 --> 06:58:57,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na napunta sa edukasyon.

8291
06:58:57,900 --> 06:59:01,240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Blockbuster yung nakaraang taon.

8292
06:59:01,660 --> 06:59:10,040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Subalit sa taong ito, sa 2027, mas nabawasan pa kesa sa 2023 ang percentage.

8293
06:59:10,760 --> 06:59:17,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi 3.34% na lamang ng GDP ang nakaalat para sa edukasyon.

8294
06:59:18,540 --> 06:59:27,100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kumbaga, sa dinami-dami ng aral, at sa dami ng sinabi ng EDCOM 1, 2, at iba pa,

8295
06:59:27,100 --> 06:59:33,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: paurong naman ang ating linalaan para sa ating budget ng edukasyon.

8296
06:59:33,480 --> 06:59:39,620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit ganun, from 3.68, 3.7, sabihin natin, naging 3.3 na lang.

8297
06:59:40,220 --> 06:59:41,400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Parang yatang paurong.

8298
06:59:41,820 --> 06:59:50,560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Madam President, currently, if you add all of the budgets for education, including tertiary,

8299
06:59:51,120 --> 06:59:54,140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we will actually still hit 4% this year.

8300
06:59:54,160 --> 06:59:55,200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You still hit 4%?

8301
06:59:55,200 --> 06:59:56,780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, we actually hit...

