9265
07:33:32,900 --> 07:33:37,140
Senator Joel Villanueva: bilang hiwalay po ito na asignatura sa elementarya.

9266
07:33:37,500 --> 07:33:46,360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And we must ensure that the values taught in our classrooms translate into everyday conduct of our learners.

9267
07:33:46,360 --> 07:33:55,360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And in this way, ma-achieve din natin yung ating ninanais para tugunan at i-address yung problema ng...

9268
07:33:55,400 --> 07:33:57,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: ng bullying sa mga paaralan.

9269
07:33:57,920 --> 07:34:02,980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pangalawa po, ginaong Pangulo na gusto kong banggitin, which is very close to my heart,

9270
07:34:03,260 --> 07:34:13,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: inaanak po ni Secretary Anggara, yung aking panganay na anak na alam po niya,

9271
07:34:13,120 --> 07:34:24,720
Senator Joel Villanueva: at even the sponsor of the measure, yung kahalagahan nung ating patuloy na ipinaglalaban at isinusulong na mas makabuluhang mga programa

9272
07:34:24,720 --> 07:34:25,380
Senator Joel Villanueva: para po sa...

9273
07:34:25,400 --> 07:34:26,920
Senator Joel Villanueva: sa ating mga SNED teachers.

9274
07:34:27,560 --> 07:34:31,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: And there was a time I was in Minuyan Elementary School.

9275
07:34:31,600 --> 07:34:38,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: I was actually monitored by our secretary, Secretary Anggara.

9276
07:34:38,720 --> 07:34:44,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I told him about this program in this particular elementary school.

9277
07:34:44,060 --> 07:34:51,980
Senator Joel Villanueva: There are 138 students, pero dadalawa ho yung guru doon, no, Mr. President.

9278
07:34:52,200 --> 07:34:54,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: And when I asked them...

9279
07:34:55,400 --> 07:35:06,000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Are they adept in any program, for example, we talk about occupational safety, occupational therapy, I mean,

9280
07:35:06,000 --> 07:35:11,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: and then programs like speech therapy, etc.

9281
07:35:11,740 --> 07:35:18,300
Senator Joel Villanueva: And how many of these children, 138 students, actually underwent assessment?

9282
07:35:19,040 --> 07:35:23,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang sabi po nila, wala pang 10% yung na-assess sa estudyante.

9283
07:35:23,420 --> 07:35:24,260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nalungkot po ako doon.

9284
07:35:24,400 --> 07:35:25,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I told the...

9285
07:35:25,240 --> 07:35:34,940
Senator Joel Villanueva: I told the secretary about this, and he asked me also to help him in ensuring na magkaroon tayo ng pondo rito, Mr. President.

9286
07:35:35,320 --> 07:35:38,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero mas nalungkot po ako nung narinig ko sa Baguio.

9287
07:35:38,500 --> 07:35:41,260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sa Baguio, Mr. President, 1 is to 450.

9288
07:35:42,320 --> 07:35:44,760
Senator Joel Villanueva: Doon po sa Iloilo, mas nakakalungkot.

9289
07:35:45,080 --> 07:35:47,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: 1 is to 900, Mr. President.

9290
07:35:48,300 --> 07:35:53,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: And now, you look at the budget, may additional budget po ba tayo sa SNED teachers,

9291
07:35:53,120 --> 07:35:55,360
Senator Joel Villanueva: eh nakakalungkot po, Mr. President.

9292
07:35:55,360 --> 07:36:00,320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. President, parang hindi po...

9293
07:36:00,320 --> 07:36:08,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. President, distinguished colleagues, Mr. Chairman, for a parent like this representation,

9294
07:36:09,580 --> 07:36:12,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: mahirap po tanggapin nito, Mr. President.

9295
07:36:12,460 --> 07:36:13,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mapakahirap po.

9296
07:36:14,480 --> 07:36:20,260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, I will not belabor the issue, but I know that our colleagues, especially our chairperson,

9297
07:36:20,440 --> 07:36:22,020
Senator Joel Villanueva: understands where I'm coming from.

9298
07:36:22,020 --> 07:36:24,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Another issue is principals, Mr. President.

9299
07:36:24,760 --> 07:36:25,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: During the...

9300
07:36:25,240 --> 07:36:27,080
Senator Joel Villanueva: During the hearing, I attended the hearing,

9301
07:36:27,640 --> 07:36:31,960
Senator Joel Villanueva: stayed with our chairperson,

9302
07:36:32,420 --> 07:36:40,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: and during the hearing, it turned out there are about 26,000 principals needed, Mr. President.

9303
07:36:40,560 --> 07:36:42,680
Senator Joel Villanueva: 26,000 needed.

9304
07:36:43,320 --> 07:36:48,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero zero po yung nilagay doon sa NEP.

9305
07:36:48,240 --> 07:36:53,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Last year, nag-alot ng 3,000 principals.

9306
07:36:53,240 --> 07:36:58,940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Last year, 6,000 principals, if I'm not mistaken.

9307
07:36:59,420 --> 07:37:01,320
Senator Joel Villanueva: 6,000 principals last year.

9308
07:37:01,600 --> 07:37:03,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: And this year, there are only 3,000.

9309
07:37:04,080 --> 07:37:09,340
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, 26,000 po yung kailangan, ang pupunan natin, 3,000, Mr. President.

9310
07:37:09,860 --> 07:37:15,040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Eh alam naman po natin, Mr. President, you and I and the education advocates here,

9311
07:37:15,400 --> 07:37:20,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: are very much aware na all decisions, lahat po ng decisions sa paaralan,

9312
07:37:20,560 --> 07:37:23,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: eh talagang nag-re-eminate sa principals.

9313
07:37:23,240 --> 07:37:26,900
Senator Joel Villanueva: At napakahalaga ng principal, Mr. President.

9314
07:37:27,300 --> 07:37:29,580
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, that's another thing that I'd like to raise.

9315
07:37:30,420 --> 07:37:34,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, second to the last one is yung aral programs.

9316
07:37:34,840 --> 07:37:37,140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Senator Aimee touched on this a while ago.

9317
07:37:40,160 --> 07:37:46,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mabagal daw yung implementation, pero ngayon nakikita naman natin na it is working.

9318
07:37:46,160 --> 07:37:47,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: It is working.

9319
07:37:48,240 --> 07:37:52,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Right now, updated total number of learners needing...

9320
07:37:53,240 --> 07:38:03,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Aral sa reading po based on school year 2026-2027 is 11 million students, Mr. President.

9321
07:38:03,700 --> 07:38:07,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: 11 million students needed remediation program.

9322
07:38:07,740 --> 07:38:12,700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nung tinignan ko po yung HGAB, yung house nakapaglagay ng 300 million.

9323
07:38:13,800 --> 07:38:20,200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tayo po dito, the entire time na ginugol natin doon po sa hearing na nandito po ako,

9324
07:38:20,200 --> 07:38:22,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: dito po mismo sa buluwagang ito,

9325
07:38:22,660 --> 07:38:23,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: nagkasundo.

9326
07:38:23,240 --> 07:38:26,860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dito po, lahat ng senador, not a single senator actually,

9327
07:38:27,220 --> 07:38:34,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: objected to implementing this, continuing this program and ensuring that we'll fund this program.

9328
07:38:34,940 --> 07:38:37,840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero dito po sa pinag-uusapan nating budget ngayon,

9329
07:38:39,040 --> 07:38:43,740
Senator Joel Villanueva: talo pa tayo ng house, 300 million, nakalagay sila tayo, wala po, Mr. President.

9330
07:38:44,280 --> 07:38:48,500
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, I just wanted to share the sentiment of this representation

9331
07:38:48,500 --> 07:38:52,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: considering that I'm one of the co-chairpersons of...

9332
07:38:53,240 --> 07:38:56,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: of the Education Commission too, Mr. President.

9333
07:38:56,240 --> 07:39:01,260
Senator Joel Villanueva: And lastly, Mr. President, nirequest ko din po sana, nakita ko kasi si Director Casimir,

9334
07:39:01,440 --> 07:39:07,820
Senator Joel Villanueva: nirequest ko po sana yung para doon sa Palarumpang Bansa na malapit po kasi sa akin yung Palarumpang Bansa.

9335
07:39:08,500 --> 07:39:14,820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ko na usasabihin kung anong taon, pero ako tayo po ay nabigyan ng pagkakataon na makalaro dito

9336
07:39:14,820 --> 07:39:19,420
Senator Joel Villanueva: at nabigyan ng parangal as one of the Hall of Famers of Palarumpang Bansa.

9337
07:39:19,420 --> 07:39:21,820
Senator Joel Villanueva: E, gagawin po ito sa Quezon City.

9338
07:39:22,000 --> 07:39:23,200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya si Senator Tito,

9339
07:39:23,240 --> 07:39:28,420
Senator Joel Villanueva: so ito, tumitingin po sa akin at dapat daw dagdagan naman ng pondo ito, Mr. President.

9340
07:39:28,540 --> 07:39:31,980
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, yun lang po, Mr. President, gusto ko lang i-share po sa inyo.

9341
07:39:32,860 --> 07:39:39,020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung frustration ko po kasi, Mr. President, last year, nung nagkaroon tayo ng budget deliberation,

9342
07:39:39,160 --> 07:39:44,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: pinasa natin yung budget for education, highest in history, parang lahat po tayo, hindi ba?

9343
07:39:44,780 --> 07:39:48,940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lahat po tayo, parang proud na proud tayong lahat, ipinagmamalaki po natin.

9344
07:39:48,940 --> 07:39:52,500
Senator Joel Villanueva: And yesterday, Mr. President, in this very roast room,

9345
07:39:53,240 --> 07:39:55,920
Senator Joel Villanueva: deliberating on the budget of our economic managers,

9346
07:39:56,220 --> 07:40:00,780
Senator Joel Villanueva: on the general principles of this budget, Mr. President,

9347
07:40:01,120 --> 07:40:06,520
Senator Joel Villanueva: I made mention that if there's one thing that this administration would be very proud of,

9348
07:40:07,280 --> 07:40:09,100
Senator Joel Villanueva: e dun po sa area ng education.

9349
07:40:09,840 --> 07:40:12,520
Senator Joel Villanueva: What happened with the latest PISA results?

9350
07:40:13,000 --> 07:40:16,100
Senator Joel Villanueva: What happened with the accomplishments of EDCOM 2?

9351
07:40:16,100 --> 07:40:21,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: E lahat nga po ng commissioner ng EDCOM, naging DepEd Secretary,

9352
07:40:21,460 --> 07:40:23,100
Senator Joel Villanueva: naging yung mga galing po sa...

9353
07:40:23,240 --> 07:40:28,740
Senator Joel Villanueva: EDCOM, naging chairperson ng CHED, naging sekretary ng PESA.

9354
07:40:28,760 --> 07:40:29,560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Naging Senate President.

9355
07:40:29,660 --> 07:40:31,920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Naging Senate President, Mr. President.

9356
07:40:32,920 --> 07:40:43,100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero, again, Mr. President, I appeal not only to the chairperson of this particular department

9357
07:40:43,100 --> 07:40:45,840
Senator Joel Villanueva: that we are deliberating upon, Mr. President,

9358
07:40:45,840 --> 07:40:52,520
Senator Joel Villanueva: I sincerely believe we can do better in giving.

9359
07:40:53,240 --> 07:40:57,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: A big chunk of the budget to our education sector.

9360
07:40:57,340 --> 07:41:01,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat, Ginong Pangulo. Maraming salamat sa ating chairperson, Sen. Bam.

9361
07:41:01,720 --> 07:41:07,920
Senator Joel Villanueva: And again, we congratulate DepEd family for having the best DepEd Secretary in the history of this nation

9362
07:41:07,920 --> 07:41:11,800
Senator Joel Villanueva: through Secretary Sani Angara. Maraming salamat, Ginong Pangulo.

9363
07:41:12,040 --> 07:41:13,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, if I may add,

9364
07:41:18,120 --> 07:41:20,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Binawi lang ni Sen. Julian sa dulo, no?

9365
07:41:21,160 --> 07:41:22,800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the truth is, Mr. President,

9366
07:41:22,800 --> 07:41:25,360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: a lot of us have shared our frustrations with this budget.

9367
07:41:25,680 --> 07:41:31,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I have spoken to the Senate President multiple times to share my frustration

9368
07:41:31,380 --> 07:41:36,440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: with the fiscal space provided for this important agency.

9369
07:41:37,980 --> 07:41:42,680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: EDCOM 2, of course, led by Sen. Julian and myself.

9370
07:41:42,860 --> 07:41:44,180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of course, ED Carol is here.

9371
07:41:44,580 --> 07:41:49,680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We've also shared our frustrations with the cuts in education that we've seen.

9372
07:41:51,440 --> 07:41:52,680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Alam naman ito ng mga kasalanan.

9373
07:41:52,800 --> 07:41:53,940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tama po natin, Mr. President.

9374
07:41:54,120 --> 07:41:55,840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We have proposed much bigger budgets.

9375
07:41:56,820 --> 07:41:58,640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sen. Joel proposed a much bigger budget.

9376
07:41:58,740 --> 07:42:06,000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I proposed a much bigger budget only to be met with an answer that we didn't like,

9377
07:42:06,100 --> 07:42:08,760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which is that the fiscal space is very limited, which we understand.

9378
07:42:09,020 --> 07:42:13,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero, Mr. President, naniniwala po ako na before the period of amendments,

9379
07:42:14,060 --> 07:42:15,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kaya pa po natin itong itaas.

9380
07:42:16,080 --> 07:42:17,760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We can still push this further.

9381
07:42:18,840 --> 07:42:22,760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Specifically, ang pinuntiri ako na po is the feeding process.

9382
07:42:22,800 --> 07:42:31,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We have ratified that law yesterday and I think it is incumbent upon us to feed the Grade 2.

9383
07:42:32,900 --> 07:42:38,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, diyan pa lang po ako pinag-uusapan ng feeding program bilang isa sa pinakamabisang solusyon

9384
07:42:38,520 --> 07:42:40,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa mga problema natin sa edukasyon.

9385
07:42:41,240 --> 07:42:47,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I think Secretary, former Senator Sunny, student leader pa rin siya, ito na yung pinag-uusapan.

9386
07:42:47,520 --> 07:42:50,040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Finally, we have the law to make this happen.

9387
07:42:50,680 --> 07:42:52,400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero, nabitin po tayo ng Grade 2.

9388
07:42:52,400 --> 07:42:54,180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In fact, the law is until Grade 3.

9389
07:42:54,820 --> 07:42:56,680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we just agreed to a progressive implementation.

9390
07:42:57,160 --> 07:43:00,820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This school year, we're already feeding universally, kinder and Grade 1.

9391
07:43:01,320 --> 07:43:03,420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sana naman next year, kasama na rin yung Grade 2.

9392
07:43:03,780 --> 07:43:07,440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then the year after that, Grade 3, which will be the full implementation of the law.

9393
07:43:07,780 --> 07:43:11,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's 6.2 billion. That's less than 0.8% of the national budget.

9394
07:43:11,680 --> 07:43:13,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm sure mahanap po natin yan.

9395
07:43:13,260 --> 07:43:18,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And Senators Pangilinan, Lacson, I know members of the minority also want to support.

9396
07:43:18,460 --> 07:43:19,880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Senator Villanueva wants to support.

9397
07:43:20,280 --> 07:43:21,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Marami po sa atin pwede magtulungan.

9398
07:43:22,400 --> 07:43:22,620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Dito.

9399
07:43:23,340 --> 07:43:27,820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, if I had a number 2 na kailangan pong pondohan, it's really the aral program.

9400
07:43:28,300 --> 07:43:30,140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because we know that it can work.

9401
07:43:30,680 --> 07:43:33,880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We've been talking about our learning gap for so many months.

9402
07:43:34,500 --> 07:43:37,900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Even before I came here, pinag-uusapan na po ito ng EDCOM 2.

9403
07:43:38,020 --> 07:43:38,960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If I'm not mistaken, no?

9404
07:43:39,020 --> 07:43:40,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This has already been identified.

9405
07:43:40,240 --> 07:43:44,320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the main solution to the learning gap is really a remediation program.

9406
07:43:45,060 --> 07:43:52,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, sa totoo lang, Mr. President, nakikita natin may mga unutilized na banggit ni Senator Marcos na 13% lang yung discharge.

9407
07:43:52,400 --> 07:43:52,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Disbursement.

9408
07:43:53,020 --> 07:43:55,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maybe that's why this was not budgeted by DBM.

9409
07:43:56,500 --> 07:43:59,540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But if we can increase this, I would support that, Mr. President.

9410
07:44:00,020 --> 07:44:06,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And in fact, I'm hoping, much like last year where we all talked about a historic budget for education,

9411
07:44:06,480 --> 07:44:11,500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I hope that, Mr. President, we can still move this budget up.

9412
07:44:11,980 --> 07:44:13,160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mataas pa po natin ito.

9413
07:44:13,340 --> 07:44:17,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And Senator Joel and I were talking yesterday and today.

9414
07:44:17,520 --> 07:44:21,420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's quite interesting that we're defending a budget which we want to increase.

9415
07:44:22,120 --> 07:44:22,220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No?

9416
07:44:22,220 --> 07:44:23,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Which we will move to increase, no?

9417
07:44:24,880 --> 07:44:29,640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But hopefully, Mr. President, with our colleagues here and eventually with our colleagues in Congress,

9418
07:44:30,120 --> 07:44:33,460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mahanapan po natin ang pondo, dagdag na pondo ang edukasyon.

9419
07:44:34,020 --> 07:44:38,740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung ako po ang tatanungin, I would choose to fund first our feeding program.

9420
07:44:39,380 --> 07:44:42,040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi yun po, Mr. President, hindi po yan dadaan sa mga ahensya.

9421
07:44:42,140 --> 07:44:43,580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi po siya dadaan sa DPWH.

9422
07:44:44,160 --> 07:44:45,460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi po yan dadaan kina mayor.

9423
07:44:46,180 --> 07:44:48,780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yan po, directly mapupunta sa mga bata.

9424
07:44:49,520 --> 07:44:51,860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 1.8 million students in grade 2.

9425
07:44:52,220 --> 07:44:54,900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Need that daily feeding program.

9426
07:44:55,540 --> 07:44:59,400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And that's, again, the price of this, Mr. President, is 6.3 billion.

9427
07:44:59,400 --> 07:44:59,500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you.

9428
07:45:00,000 --> 07:45:03,800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The National Children's Nutrition Program is a top priority of this government.

9429
07:45:04,180 --> 07:45:06,380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nabanggit rin po ito ni Sen. Joel kahapon.

9430
07:45:06,480 --> 07:45:09,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Gumagawa tayo ng mga batas, kailangan natin pondohan yung mga reformang ito.

9431
07:45:10,440 --> 07:45:13,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So let's fund this law, let's increase the budget of education.

9432
07:45:13,920 --> 07:45:19,560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At yung nabanggit kanina ni Sen. Aimee na pasangawang 4%, 4.02,

9433
07:45:19,780 --> 07:45:21,980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sana naman makiat natin siya further.

9434
07:45:22,120 --> 07:45:23,600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We can push it further, Mr. President.

9435
07:45:23,780 --> 07:45:29,700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I know many of our colleagues can come together and fund education even better than what we have now.

9436
07:45:29,700 --> 07:45:32,560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So with that, let me thank my chairman.

9437
07:45:32,880 --> 07:45:37,260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: By the way, ang una pong topic kasi, SNED, nakalimutan kong banggitin.

9438
07:45:37,820 --> 07:45:45,980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We have already requested EDCOM to do a more serious and a deeper study on our SNED.

9439
07:45:46,400 --> 07:45:51,720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because Mr. President, yung developmental pediatrician, kahit mapondohan po natin yan, kulang talaga sa Pilipinas.

9440
07:45:52,160 --> 07:45:55,040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Even if we had the funding, which we don't, there's not enough.

9441
07:45:55,040 --> 07:45:59,040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So we want to have a deeper understanding of how we can support

9442
07:45:59,700 --> 07:46:03,700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and care for our special needs children even better.

9443
07:46:04,020 --> 07:46:09,140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Which I know, Mr. President, the good chairman of higher education will also be supportive on this.

9444
07:46:09,200 --> 07:46:11,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So let me thank everyone. Maraming salamat.

9445
07:46:11,620 --> 07:46:14,120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I'm hoping we're done.

9446
07:46:14,600 --> 07:46:18,300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But if we're not, we have, of course, time for more questions, Mr. President.

9447
07:46:18,640 --> 07:46:22,000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just a quick reaction, Majority Leader.

9448
07:46:22,820 --> 07:46:27,020
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Last year, ang ating allocation is about 1.3 trillion pesos.

9449
07:46:27,260 --> 07:46:29,000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So that's about 4.4%.

9450
07:46:29,700 --> 07:46:38,340
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Last year, kasi nagkaroon tayo ng opportunity because of the flood control issue.

9451
07:46:39,000 --> 07:46:41,320
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Naging opportunity yan for education.

9452
07:46:42,100 --> 07:46:47,400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dahil nung tinanggal yung flood control, nagkaroon tayo ng space na ilinagay natin sa classroom,

9453
07:46:47,720 --> 07:46:52,400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sa aral program, sa feeding program, additional teachers, textbooks.

9454
07:46:52,400 --> 07:46:58,460
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At nagpapasalamat po ako kay Secretary Angara dahil yung pondo na yun ay nagamit,

9455
07:46:58,900 --> 07:46:59,520
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: especially for the education.

9456
07:46:59,700 --> 07:47:00,280
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For textbooks.

9457
07:47:01,080 --> 07:47:06,100
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, but this time around, dahil nag-regular programming ang DPWH,

9458
07:47:06,700 --> 07:47:09,600
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: naging masikip yung fiscal space.

9459
07:47:09,740 --> 07:47:13,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero hindi pa naman tapos, Senator Bam, yung budget process.

9460
07:47:13,880 --> 07:47:22,340
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At I share your sentiment na kailangan ay buhusan natin ng pondo ang sektor ng edukasyon,

9461
07:47:22,460 --> 07:47:28,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: lalo na kung nandito si Secretary Angara, isang education champion at former EDCOM,

9462
07:47:29,700 --> 07:47:30,340
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: commissioner.

9463
07:47:31,060 --> 07:47:34,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nasa magandang kamay ang Department of Education.

9464
07:47:35,200 --> 07:47:36,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, we'll work with you on that one.

9465
07:47:37,440 --> 07:47:42,260
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At least makahanap pa tayo ng additional funds for the feeding program and aral program.

9466
07:47:42,540 --> 07:47:43,720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Mr. President.

9467
07:47:43,880 --> 07:47:45,000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May I mention one thing?

9468
07:47:45,100 --> 07:47:51,280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Since anyway, 846 na rin and mas masarap makipag-usap kapag gabing-gabi na, di ba?

9469
07:47:51,280 --> 07:47:53,160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Wala naman tayong hinahabol na oras.

9470
07:47:54,380 --> 07:47:59,100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, yung ibang mga proyekto kasi,

9471
07:47:59,700 --> 07:48:04,760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: pwede siyang, you know, for this year, marami kang pondo for a certain project.

9472
07:48:05,540 --> 07:48:09,120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For next year, pwedeng wala muna kung may problema ka sa fiscal space.

9473
