Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ako po, that's my position.

9476
07:48:21,260 --> 07:48:22,440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's the position of the committee.

9477
07:48:22,440 --> 07:48:28,160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If we are providing support for X million children on this year,

9478
07:48:28,640 --> 07:48:29,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kailangan next year.

9479
