Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: next season, wala ka ng tulong, natanggal ka sa listahan, hindi naman pwede yun.

9500
07:49:36,460 --> 07:49:37,820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kailangan tuloy-tuloy po yung tulong.

9501
07:49:38,320 --> 07:49:42,600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, the feeding program, the scholarships, kapag nabigay na,

9502
