Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But we've found some solutions.

9508
07:49:59,520 --> 07:50:00,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We've found some solutions for the scholarships.

9509
07:50:00,680 --> 07:50:01,800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It was also initially cut.

9510
07:50:02,480 --> 07:50:03,560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We've found the solution.

9511
07:50:03,820 --> 07:50:07,260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, at least yung scholarships, pwede ho nating sabihin, pwedeng tuloy-tuloy.

9512
07:50:07,660 --> 07:50:10,340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Although, TESDA, we're still looking for solutions for TESDA.

9513
07:50:10,800 --> 07:50:13,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ito pong feeding program, sana pong magkaisa tayo to support this.

9514
07:50:13,560 --> 07:50:14,300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Mr. President.

9515
07:50:14,420 --> 07:50:14,940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maraming salamat.

